add("NewParents-1xc03wo", None, "experienced_mother", "baby_9_12_months", "failure_story", ["sleep_consultant", "short_naps"], "We have attempted sleep training, even hired a consultant to guide us on sleep schedules. Nothing is working for us and baby’s naps are not improving at all.", "10-month-old second child; mother home full time with a 4-year-old too.")
add("NewParents-1xc03wo", None, "experienced_mother", "baby_9_12_months", "pain", ["short_naps", "guilt"], "He rarely sleeps more than 40 minutes without me having to intervene and rock him to stay asleep. I can’t keep doing it and neglecting my 4yo.", "Nap struggle with two children at home.")
add("sleeptrain-1xcbqe0", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "pain", ["early_waking", "app_tracking"], "I go to bed thinking “ah lovely he might give me a lie in until 6am”, I see he’s popped his eyes open at 5:15", "Baby falls asleep independently; parent tracks every nap in an app and still gets 5:15 starts.")
add("sleeptrain-1xcbqe0", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "tried_failed", ["app_tracking", "wake_windows"], "I track his naps and night sleep with Huckleberry so I know he averages about 12,5 to 13 hours total.", "Post titled: Early morning wakes: I tried it all.")
add("sleeptrain-1xcddf9", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_9_12_months", "tried_failed", ["sleep_consultant", "personalization"], "We tried sleep training with a sleep consultant at 8 months but as my son was also having issues with weaning onto solids she recommended that we pause until he was older.", "11.5-month-old has slept through twice in his life.")
add("sleeptrain-1xcddf9", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_9_12_months", "fear", ["daycare_naps", "maternal_exhaustion"], "I’m so tired and anxious about how I will cope when I go back to work.", "Returning to work; the childminder struggles even more with naps.")
add("sleeptrain-1xcfrm1", None, "experienced_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "belief", ["course_purchase", "early_waking"], "She has a very typical schedule based on Taking Cara Babies/Moms On Call. I was lucky and didn’t have to sleep train her", "Second-time mom; 6-month-old cycles through 5am wakes.")
add("sleeptrain-1xcmw6p", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_9_12_months", "success_story", ["sleep_consultant", "night_weaning", "wake_windows"], "We started working with a sleep consultant and she helped us adjust her schedule before sleep training as we were asking our daughter for too much sleep, and we ended up on a 3.5/3.5/3.5 schedule. Sleep training took 5 days and we also night weaned at the same time.", "Re-trained at nearly 10 months after travel and illness; slept through for a week.")
add("sleeptrain-1xcmw6p", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_9_12_months", "pain", ["guilt", "ferber"], "I feel like such a bad mom knowing that her schedule is causing her to be under tired at night and poor girl is being left to figure it out. We do check ins every 10 minutes, but I can’t stand listening to her cry anymore!", "Split nights returned after the consultant-led week.")
add("sleeptrain-1xcwhi4", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "failure_story", ["course_purchase", "night_wakings"], "The remaining 30% of nights she is inconsolable right around 4 am, and the TCB program doesn't seem to be working like it did.", "Followed paid course plans 'pretty religiously'; illness brought night feeds back.")
add("sleeptrain-1xcwhi4", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "fear", ["night_weaning", "guilt"], "OR if we are horrible parents who should be feeding her much earlier in the process.", "Unsure whether 4am crying is hunger.")
add("sleeptrain-1xcwhi4", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "objection", ["course_purchase", "personalization", "dream_feed"], "We could follow TCB advise and start initiating a feed before she wakes up, but since she doesn't need in 60% of the time, that seems silly.", "Course rule does not fit an intermittent pattern.")
add("sleeptrain-1xcy90v", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "objection", ["sleep_consultant", "wake_windows"], "I often see people in here asking how to extend their kids wake windows and I feel the opposite. How do I shorten mine???", "8-month-old taking 4-5 hour wake windows; naps imploded.")
add("sleeptrain-1xcy90v", "19rjl9t7wkhsx", "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "tried_failed", ["sleep_consultant"], "The sleep consultant couldn't see us early enough before the vacation to get into a solid enough rhythm.", "Consultant booked for after a two-week trip.")
add("sleeptrain-1xcy90v", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "pain", ["short_naps", "contact_naps"], "But I'm on the verge of tears most nap times now and would love help until then.", "Waiting for the consultant start date.")
add("sleeptrain-1xd2gbc", None, "new_mother", "regression_4_months", "price_signal", ["smart_bassinet", "price_value", "regression_4_month"], "We even splurged on the stupid fancy Cradlewise because she loved the rockit as a newborn and thought it would be more effective and give us more sleep (wrong).", "16-week-old now waking up to 8 times a night.")
add("sleeptrain-1xd2gbc", None, "new_mother", "regression_4_months", "price_signal", ["app_tracking", "personalization", "subscription_resentment"], "We’ve paid huckleberry to make a sleep schedule but its all out the door when naps and wake windows are so short. They expect her to nap for an hour plus each time which isn’t realistic.", "Paid app schedule did not fit 30-40 minute naps.")
add("sleeptrain-1xd2gbc", None, "new_mother", "regression_4_months", "pain", ["partner_split_nights", "maternal_exhaustion"], "My baby is EBF and I’m solo parenting most of the time due to my husbands traveling career and I’m lucky to get 5h of incredibly broken sleep.", "Wakings began at 8-9 weeks.")
add("sleeptrain-1xd2gbc", None, "new_mother", "regression_4_months", "pain", ["bedtime_battle"], "We know bedtime is going to be a multiple-hour event.", "False start 30-40 minutes after any bedtime.")
add("sleeptrain-1xdfq3r", None, "parent_unspecified", "unknown", "price_signal", ["sleep_consultant", "price_value"], "We’re on a budget but I’m willing to pay at this point bc this is unbearable.", "Second post asking for consultant recommendations.")
add("sleeptrain-1xdfq3r", None, "parent_unspecified", "unknown", "desire", ["free_advice", "sleep_consultant"], "Or if there is someone willing to message me to help a girl out I would be so appreciative.", "Hoping for free one-to-one help instead.")
add("toddlers-1xdhll2", None, "parent_unspecified", "toddler_12_24_months", "failure_story", ["sleep_consultant", "app_tracking", "gave_up"], "Yes I’ve done all the sleep training methods and a consultant, tried all the tricks, data tracked different room temps, desperately tried to recreate the settings that got us 9 hours those 10 times.", "22-month-old still not sleeping through.")
add("toddlers-1xdhll2", None, "parent_unspecified", "toddler_12_24_months", "pain", ["comparison_other_babies", "resentment"], "I just wanted a place to say it sucks not being one of the blessed ones with sleepers and my god, the parenting experience is so different. It sucks. I want a second and just can’t even imagine it yet.", "Venting after everything failed.")
add("sleeptrain-1xdhv8a", None, "parent_unspecified", "regression_4_months", "pain", ["information_overload", "maternal_exhaustion"], "I feel like I’ve been reading and doom-scrolling nonstop trying to figure out our baby’s sleep, and I’m honestly exhausted.", "16-week-old with false starts until 10pm; parent weighing methods and a book on order.")
add("sleeptrain-1xdhv8a", None, "parent_unspecified", "regression_4_months", "tried_failed", ["app_tracking", "wake_windows"], "I often find 1.5 hours is too soon for her, but I’m not sure whether I’m missing her sleepy cues or if Huckleberry is off.", "App wake windows versus the baby.")
add("sleeptrain-1xdhv8a", None, "parent_unspecified", "regression_4_months", "question", ["course_purchase", "book_purchase", "information_overload"], "We’re considering Ferber or Taking Cara Babies, but I’ve also ordered *Precious Little Sleep*, which should arrive this week.", "Choosing a method before December travel.")
add("sleeptrain-1xdhv8a", None, "parent_unspecified", "regression_4_months", "pain", ["bedtime_battle", "partner_split_nights"], "I feel like I spend the entire evening going back and forth to her crib until I eventually give up and bring her into bed.", "No evening time with her husband.")
